1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Threatened by a ruthless demon, humanity was on the brink of destruction.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
All seemed lost until a lone mage stepped forward and took up the fight.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:29,000
After his triumph, he was hailed as the Wizard King, and his story became legend.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
The Black Bulls have finally made it to the Underwater Temple. However, when they arrived...

5
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:42,000
You came to my temple to seek the magic stone, didn't you? If you want it, you'll have to play a game with me first!

6
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:47,000
A mysterious old man, the High Priest, and his nine temple mages were waiting for them.

7
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:54,000
The High Priest separated the Black Bulls, telling them they must fight the mages nine on nine if they want to leave with the magic stone.

8
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:01,000
The team that wipes out all of their opponents, or the one with the most players left standing when the game concludes, will be the winner!

9
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Oh yeah! I'm so there! This is gonna be a total bloodbath!

10
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Hold on. Did he say it was going to be a nine on nine battle? But there should be ten of us.

11
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Alright! I got it! Now let's go! I'm ready!

12
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:23,000
How interesting. I'm not sensing so much as a scrap of magic coming from you. Too bad. Looks like I got a dud.

13
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:29,000
You think I'm a dud, huh? Just try me and find out!

14
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,000
Bye!

15
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Bye!

16
