真っ暗な音ろへ

36
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:45,260
Just move it back

37
00:02:45,260 --> 00:02:47,260
La la la la la...

38
00:02:47,260 --> 00:02:48,760
Wow!

39
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:50,360
Just move it back

40
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:52,680
La-la-la-la-la-la-la-la

41
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:55,280
You don't mind, I'll keep the books coming back

42
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:23,760
I'm afraid that won't work, you're too strong

43
00:03:23,760 --> 00:03:25,920
I've been looking forward to this

44
00:03:25,920 --> 00:03:29,300
And so have all the good people who are watching from outside

45
00:03:29,300 --> 00:03:32,740
Can't have the fun end too quickly, now can we?

46
00:03:33,860 --> 00:03:37,520
Well, hell, looks like you've got a good eye for fighting skill, old man

47
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:39,740
This geezer knows a thing or two

48
00:03:39,740 --> 00:03:45,380
Oh, looks like some of the competitors have crossed paths

49
00:03:45,380 --> 00:03:48,080
Those idiots better not lose or I'll kill them

50
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:54,960
I'm so cold, I'm gonna make that crazy old bastard pay

51
00:03:54,960 --> 00:04:00,440
That's priceless, fire magic in an underwater temple

52
00:04:00,440 --> 00:04:02,440
This should be very entertaining

53
00:04:02,440 --> 00:04:05,980
So small and fragile looking

54
00:04:05,980 --> 00:04:09,360
I'll almost feel ashamed when I tear you apart

55
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:12,340
Oh, are you the one I get to fight?

56
00:04:14,340 --> 00:04:17,340
I've heard of you people, you're the Black Bulls

57
00:04:17,340 --> 00:04:20,760
They say you're the weakest of all the Magic Knight squads

58
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:25,220
Marie is waiting, let's just get this over with

59
00:04:25,220 --> 00:04:31,220
So you know, waving around that rusty old sword is a waste of your time

60
00:04:31,220 --> 00:04:34,860
I can dodge any attack you throw at me with my mollusk magic

61
00:04:34,860 --> 00:04:42,320
My toes are practically tingling

62
00:04:42,320 --> 00:04:46,580
Out of curiosity, Captain, how are those mages of yours ranked?

63
00:04:46,880 --> 00:04:48,560
They're all still at the junior level

64
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:51,560
I'm surprised you know about ranks living down here

65
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:57,640
All my temple mages are more powerful than intermediate class magic knights

66
00:04:57,640 --> 00:05:00,060
And they're out there fighting a bunch of juniors?

67
00:05:00,060 --> 00:05:03,060
Your poor schmucks don't stand a chance in this battle

68
00:05:03,060 --> 00:05:05,060
Wow, that's bad

69
00:05:05,060 --> 00:05:06,520
Guess we're in trouble

70
00:05:06,520 --> 00:05:12,520
Unless those poor schmucks are actually stronger than their ranks suggest

71
00:05:12,520 --> 00:05:15,060
They're losing! That's impossible!

72
00:05:15,060 --> 00:05:20,660
It's gonna take more than a few drops of water to scare me off

73
00:05:20,660 --> 00:05:23,180
I say we turn this little battle into a fish fry

74
00:05:23,180 --> 00:05:25,680
I guess that must have been one of their weaker guys

75
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:28,380
How boring, wonder where the tough ones are

76
00:05:28,380 --> 00:05:31,660
There, now that's done, we can move on to much more important things

77
00:05:31,660 --> 00:05:33,180
Like getting back to Marie

78
00:05:33,180 --> 00:05:37,720
I don't understand

79
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:42,020
My mollusk magic should be able to deflect any kind of physical attack

80
00:05:42,020 --> 00:05:46,140
That stuff's not gonna work on me! This is an anti-magic sword!

81
00:05:47,900 --> 00:05:49,180
Who's up next?

82
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:56,380
Yeah, beat the crap out of those fish!

83
00:05:58,220 --> 00:06:00,480
Idiots! Letting them get the drop on you!

84
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:04,020
Hey, how about we bet on which team's gonna win this game of yours?

85
00:06:04,340 --> 00:06:06,400
I'm putting 10,000 Yule on the bulls

86
00:06:06,400 --> 00:06:08,860
Please! This is just the beginning

87
00:06:08,860 --> 00:06:12,780
The mages who are left won't go down as easily as those others

88
00:06:12,780 --> 00:06:17,680
In fact, my three great mages rival senior ranked magic knights in terms of power

89
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:22,420
Don't see me

90
00:06:22,420 --> 00:06:27,600
Phew, that was a close one

91
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:30,300
I have no desire to fight someone that scary looking

92
00:06:30,300 --> 00:06:33,060
I've been trying to get back to where this all started

93
00:06:33,060 --> 00:06:34,800
But I can't seem to for some reason

94
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:38,620
Looks like for now I can only use magic to get to places that I can see

95
00:06:38,620 --> 00:06:42,220
Oh yes, there's one thing I neglected to tell you

96
00:06:42,220 --> 00:06:45,620
Until the game is over, you won't be able to leave!

97
00:06:45,700 --> 00:06:47,700
Hey! Are you watching me, old man?

98
00:06:47,780 --> 00:06:50,760
Federal, quit hiding and fight already, you wuss

99
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:53,900
Wait, you're watching too yummy? But how?

100
00:06:54,060 --> 00:06:55,880
Don't tell me you're with the crazy priest

101
00:06:55,880 --> 00:06:58,460
We're having a feast with your fights as the entertainment

102
00:06:58,460 --> 00:07:03,520
What? If you're with him, can't you get him to call off this game? It's brutal!

103
00:07:03,780 --> 00:07:06,220
Yeah, the brutal part's what makes it fun

104
00:07:06,220 --> 00:07:07,900
I couldn't have said it better

105
00:07:07,900 --> 00:07:09,580
Great, they're buddies now?

106
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:13,600
You know, this'll be a lot less fun if your knights are just gonna run away

107
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:15,420
Yeah, we gotta make them fight

108
00:07:15,420 --> 00:07:18,060
Well, it's time for some nuisance magic

109
00:07:18,060 --> 00:07:21,100
Game magic, master time!

110
00:07:21,100 --> 00:07:35,100
Look at him go! I should give him a few more to play with

111
00:07:35,100 --> 00:07:36,600
Listen up, geezer

112
00:07:36,600 --> 00:07:38,700
That didn't look deadly enough

113
00:07:38,700 --> 00:07:40,440
Can you whip up something more like this?

114
00:07:40,580 --> 00:07:43,720
Just to clarify, you're on their side, aren't you?

115
00:07:44,080 --> 00:07:45,160
Nice drawing, though

116
00:07:45,160 --> 00:07:49,080
Now, let's see how the rest of those little idiots are holding up

117
00:07:49,080 --> 00:07:52,260
Gray's turned into a crab and scuttled off somewhere

118
00:07:52,260 --> 00:07:53,800
Gonna kill them around later

119
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:56,760
Oh, looks like Charmy's fighting

120
00:07:56,760 --> 00:08:02,300
Wow, I've never seen anything like this before

121
00:08:02,300 --> 00:08:06,720
Yes, the underwater temple's denizens are truly yummy!

122
00:08:08,860 --> 00:08:10,320
Show our jumps!

123
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:13,780
Invite a northern sheep for you so magnificent

124
00:08:13,780 --> 00:08:15,920
You're out of control for a long time ago

125
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:17,640
For a strong magic reason or not

126
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:23,100
Aw, if only my prince of provisions were here to savor this feast with me

127
00:08:23,100 --> 00:08:25,200
That's it!

128
00:08:25,200 --> 00:08:29,060
I hereby claim this ecosystem in the name of Charmy!

129
00:08:31,200 --> 00:08:33,440
And I'm gonna keep eating till it's empty!

130
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:34,660
Ha ha ha ha!

131
00:08:34,660 --> 00:08:36,320
Ha ha ha ha!

132
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:37,820
Ha ha ha ha!

133
00:08:37,820 --> 00:08:39,320
What, uh...

134
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:41,260
Is she doing exactly?

135
00:08:41,260 --> 00:08:43,240
Oh, yeah

136
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:44,600
Here we go

137
00:08:44,600 --> 00:08:46,140
And it's all for me

138
00:08:46,140 --> 00:08:47,060
Found you!

139
00:08:47,060 --> 00:08:48,060
Ha ha ha ha!

140
00:08:48,060 --> 00:08:51,060
Oh, look at what a cutie you are

141
00:08:51,060 --> 00:08:53,280
Too bad I'm gonna have to squash you

142
00:08:53,280 --> 00:08:54,160
Ha ha ha!

143
00:08:54,160 --> 00:08:55,240
Is that right?

144
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:59,460
Well, right now I'm full of mana from all those tasty little sea creatures I ate

145
00:08:59,460 --> 00:09:03,500
You want to see if you'll manage any better against my teeth than they did?

146
00:09:03,500 --> 00:09:05,440
Then let's dance!

147
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:08,360
Awwww!

148
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:10,900
Song Magic, Mother Lullaby

149
00:09:10,900 --> 00:09:22,960
Wow, I feel really good all of a sudden

150
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:27,900
No way, I can hear more

151
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:29,660
That's one down.

152
00:09:33,260 --> 00:09:36,100
Oh, I should have mentioned that sleeping counts as a knockout.

153
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:39,380
Well, what do you think now that you've seen one of my great mages in action?

154
00:09:39,900 --> 00:09:42,540
When we get back, she's on short rations for a week.

155
00:09:43,020 --> 00:09:46,320
That was fun. Maybe I'll run into my new friends next.

156
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:52,000
Nice. My clothes are finally dry after that dowsing earlier.

157
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:54,300
I wonder who my next victim's gonna be.

158
00:09:54,300 --> 00:09:59,100
Huh? Well, it looks like you're still alive and kicking, Lightning Boy.

159
00:09:59,100 --> 00:10:01,500
Yep. And I knocked out a temple mage.

160
00:10:01,500 --> 00:10:04,700
I headed this way because I thought I was picking up on something pretty strong.

161
00:10:08,100 --> 00:10:10,400
And oh goody, it looks like I was right.

162
00:10:10,900 --> 00:10:14,400
Hell yeah. Now we just gotta decide which one of us are gonna-

163
00:10:14,400 --> 00:10:17,400
Hey, look! No fear! Come back here, you jerk!

164
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:20,400
Ha ha ha ha! But comfort serve! Sorry!

165
00:10:24,300 --> 00:10:27,100
Lightning magic! Thunderbolt Destruction!

166
00:10:29,100 --> 00:10:31,800
Water creation magic! See God, see him!

167
00:10:37,500 --> 00:10:41,100
He's tough. Lightning and water should be a good match, too.

168
00:10:41,100 --> 00:10:44,300
Well, well. Aren't you a spunky little fella?

169
00:10:44,300 --> 00:10:45,300
Ha ha ha!

170
00:10:45,300 --> 00:10:47,800
Ready.

171
00:10:48,500 --> 00:10:50,800
Yaargh! Gotcha slimy!

172
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:51,360
Hiya!

173
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:52,860
Hiya!

174
00:10:53,400 --> 00:10:54,100
Huff.

175
00:10:59,200 --> 00:11:01,700
That key. Someon's there.

176
00:11:02,100 --> 00:11:05,340
The

177
00:11:06,100 --> 00:11:10,200
Aww, come on, Grandpa. Can't you save the nuisance spells for the other team?

178
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:13,500
Well, whatever. It was a good warm-up, I guess.

179
00:11:14,580 --> 00:11:16,380
He beat that huge thing?

180
00:11:16,820 --> 00:11:17,500
Who is he?

181
00:11:18,520 --> 00:11:18,860
Huh?

182
00:11:19,540 --> 00:11:22,200
Oh, hey there. You're Asta, aren't you?

183
00:11:22,920 --> 00:11:24,660
Uh, yeah, that's me.

184
00:11:25,040 --> 00:11:29,120
I've heard about you. You wield a strange sword that cancels out magic.

185
00:11:29,500 --> 00:11:30,860
Sure, that's right.

186
00:11:31,140 --> 00:11:32,620
Wait, heard what from who?

187
00:11:33,440 --> 00:11:36,060
Never mind that. Check out this dance.

188
00:11:37,400 --> 00:11:39,660
But we're supposed to be fighting!

189
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:53,920
Still, that's a pretty awesome dance!

190
00:11:54,820 --> 00:11:57,060
How do you think it'd go over on land?

191
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:59,140
They would love it!

192
00:11:59,480 --> 00:12:03,640
I'm Kioto. My dream is to captivate the entire kingdom with my dancing!

193
00:12:04,400 --> 00:12:06,060
Now he's talking about his dreams?

194
00:12:07,060 --> 00:12:14,020
Except, while we underwater temple folk can go to the kingdom's beaches if we want, we're not allowed to visit any of the cities.

195
00:12:15,460 --> 00:12:17,140
But that could change soon!

196
00:12:17,560 --> 00:12:19,780
Because if I win this fight, then Grandpa...

197
00:12:19,780 --> 00:12:22,160
Oh, yeah, the high priest is my grandfather, by the way.

198
00:12:22,500 --> 00:12:25,400
Anyhow, he said he'll use his authority to let me go ashore!

199
00:12:26,420 --> 00:12:29,940
Yes! I'm going to make it big as a star dancer!

200
00:12:30,680 --> 00:12:32,160
That's a huge dream, alright!

201
00:12:32,920 --> 00:12:33,840
Hey, wait.

202
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:36,120
Where have I heard something like that before?

203
00:12:37,260 --> 00:12:38,840
So I must apologize!

204
00:12:39,460 --> 00:12:42,620
But for the sake of my dream, you must lose this fight!

205
00:12:42,940 --> 00:12:43,720
So fast!

206
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:52,120
Yeah, well, you're not the only one with a dream!

207
00:12:52,920 --> 00:12:53,200
Huh?

208
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:54,540
That's right.

209
00:12:55,120 --> 00:12:59,460
I want to become the strongest mage, the Wizard King, the protector of the kingdom!

210
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:01,220
So sorry.

211
00:13:01,780 --> 00:13:05,940
But for the sake of my dream, I'm going to take you down!

212
00:13:05,940 --> 00:13:07,580
All right.

213
00:13:08,940 --> 00:13:13,540
We'll both put our dreams on the line, and fight without holding anything back!

214
00:13:13,840 --> 00:13:15,660
I wouldn't have it any other way!

215
00:13:18,020 --> 00:13:18,540
Great.

216
00:13:18,760 --> 00:13:20,020
What am I supposed to do?

217
00:13:20,440 --> 00:13:24,060
How can I fight when I haven't learned a single proper attack spell yet?

218
00:13:28,160 --> 00:13:28,640
Awesome!

219
00:13:29,060 --> 00:13:30,440
I finally found you!

220
00:13:30,620 --> 00:13:32,120
Oh no, a temple mage!

221
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:36,260
Well, I suppose it's only fair to warn you I am royalty!

222
00:13:36,600 --> 00:13:37,720
Fight at your own risk!

223
00:13:37,900 --> 00:13:39,240
Now's your last chance to run!

224
00:13:40,140 --> 00:13:41,100
How cute!

225
00:13:41,520 --> 00:13:43,400
I'm so glad you came, Noelle!

226
00:13:43,760 --> 00:13:45,460
Wait a sec, how do you know my name?

227
00:13:45,900 --> 00:13:46,820
Oh, silly me!

228
00:13:46,980 --> 00:13:48,680
I forgot about the whole mask thing!

229
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:55,640
Kohono!

230
00:13:56,600 --> 00:13:58,140
I've been waiting for you!

231
00:13:58,280 --> 00:13:58,760
Hiya!

232
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:08,740
You live here?

233
00:14:09,140 --> 00:14:11,620
You're one of the temple mages we're supposed to fight.

234
00:14:11,980 --> 00:14:14,960
Then why were you so eager to help me learn how to control my magic?

235
00:14:15,600 --> 00:14:16,820
Yeah, about that.

236
00:14:16,940 --> 00:14:18,800
I wasn't just practicing up by the beach,

237
00:14:18,820 --> 00:14:22,040
I was also looking for people who wanted to come down and visit us.

238
00:14:22,160 --> 00:14:23,840
When we have visitors, Grandpa, um,

239
00:14:24,040 --> 00:14:26,540
the High Priest, always wants to play this game.

240
00:14:26,540 --> 00:14:29,340
And if I win, then I get to go ashore,

241
00:14:29,580 --> 00:14:31,740
which means that I can finally become an idol!

242
00:14:32,220 --> 00:14:32,900
That's why?

243
00:14:33,500 --> 00:14:35,700
So then, you were using me the whole time!

244
00:14:36,080 --> 00:14:36,380
What?

245
00:14:36,920 --> 00:14:38,040
No, I wasn't.

246
00:14:38,700 --> 00:14:40,340
When I saw how hard you were trying,

247
00:14:40,460 --> 00:14:41,900
I really did want to help you,

248
00:14:42,080 --> 00:14:44,460
and I totally still want to be your friend, too.

249
00:14:45,180 --> 00:14:45,580
But!

250
00:14:46,140 --> 00:14:48,580
Now we're facing off against each other in this game,

251
00:14:48,660 --> 00:14:50,420
and we have to fight fair and square!

252
00:14:50,900 --> 00:14:51,720
But why?

253
00:14:51,920 --> 00:14:53,960
You just said we were friends, didn't you?

254
00:14:53,960 --> 00:14:54,760
Yep!

255
00:14:55,260 --> 00:14:57,860
But real friends can fight for what's most important to them

256
00:14:57,860 --> 00:15:00,360
and still be able to laugh with each other afterwards!

257
00:15:01,320 --> 00:15:02,040
Song magic!

258
00:15:02,560 --> 00:15:03,660
Mother Lullaby!

259
00:15:08,220 --> 00:15:09,420
What's this spell?

260
00:15:09,840 --> 00:15:11,960
It's making me...

261
00:15:12,660 --> 00:15:15,340
Water creation magic!

262
00:15:15,740 --> 00:15:17,020
Sea Dragon's Lair!

263
00:15:17,360 --> 00:15:19,200
Oh, so you are ready to fight!

264
00:15:21,500 --> 00:15:22,460
Song magic!

265
00:15:23,120 --> 00:15:24,240
Destructive bait!

266
00:15:27,920 --> 00:15:29,560
Oh, come on, Noelle!

267
00:15:29,780 --> 00:15:31,840
You've got to use some attack spells, too!

268
00:15:32,540 --> 00:15:34,680
I really didn't want to do this!

269
00:15:36,080 --> 00:15:36,600
Wow!

270
00:15:36,900 --> 00:15:38,620
That's just from releasing her magic power?

271
00:15:38,980 --> 00:15:39,500
Jeez!

272
00:15:41,120 --> 00:15:41,640
Really?

273
00:15:41,940 --> 00:15:43,580
What the heck are you doing, Noelle?

274
00:15:43,720 --> 00:15:45,940
There's no point attacking if you're just gonna miss!

275
00:15:46,180 --> 00:15:48,460
You need to aim correctly if you want to beat me!

276
00:15:49,900 --> 00:15:50,460
Shut up!

277
00:15:50,460 --> 00:15:51,100
Shut up!

278
00:15:52,460 --> 00:15:56,100
I still can't control my attacks, but you don't have to be such a jerk about it, okay?

279
00:15:56,680 --> 00:16:00,460
Sure you can. What are you talking about? You're controlling your magic just fine.

280
00:16:01,720 --> 00:16:04,720
You're unconsciously trying to avoid attacking me.

281
00:16:05,140 --> 00:16:06,400
You don't want to hurt people.

282
00:16:07,860 --> 00:16:12,160
Now that works out fine for me, but think about the reason that you're here.

283
00:16:12,540 --> 00:16:15,080
Didn't you come because you wanted to see a dream fulfilled?

284
00:16:22,460 --> 00:16:25,860
Well, that isn't going to happen unless you fight me and win.

285
00:16:26,680 --> 00:16:28,160
Why did I come?

286
00:16:29,360 --> 00:16:31,280
Because I want to help the others.

287
00:16:33,660 --> 00:16:35,000
Fine, let's fight!

288
00:16:46,940 --> 00:16:50,660
This guy's really strong, and the way he moves is crazy.

289
00:16:50,660 --> 00:16:53,780
It's like his mind's not here, but off somewhere else.

290
00:16:54,200 --> 00:16:55,560
His key's so hard to read!

291
00:17:02,360 --> 00:17:04,460
Feels like he's scrambling my senses.

292
00:17:05,560 --> 00:17:06,460
Is that his magic?

293
00:17:07,800 --> 00:17:08,800
As I thought.

294
00:17:09,500 --> 00:17:14,040
Against my real blades, your anti-magic sword is nothing more than a chunk of steel.

295
00:17:14,600 --> 00:17:19,420
With my dance magic as an added bonus, you can't track my movements at all!

296
00:17:20,660 --> 00:17:23,680
Ha ha! My grandson's pretty powerful, don't you think?

297
00:17:24,060 --> 00:17:27,620
Nice swordsmanship, I'll give him that. But still...

298
00:17:27,620 --> 00:17:30,820
Well, Asuka? Come on, aren't you ready to surrender yet?

299
00:17:31,360 --> 00:17:32,020
Not good!

300
00:17:32,440 --> 00:17:34,020
If he keeps this up, I'm in trouble!

301
00:17:34,440 --> 00:17:35,840
It's like trying to grab water!

302
00:17:37,780 --> 00:17:38,640
Wait a second.

303
00:17:39,180 --> 00:17:40,800
Maybe strength's not what I need.

304
00:17:41,360 --> 00:17:43,660
Water's shapeless, so grabbing it's impossible.

305
00:17:43,660 --> 00:17:48,300
Stay calm.

306
00:17:49,920 --> 00:17:50,380
I know!

307
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:51,320
Woo!

308
00:17:52,200 --> 00:17:55,080
If I want to beat him, I have to be like water, too!

309
00:17:55,900 --> 00:17:58,360
Monkey see, monkey do. Now that's amusing.

310
00:17:58,880 --> 00:17:59,540
Ooh! Ah!

311
00:17:59,720 --> 00:18:01,400
Watch what this monkey can do!

312
00:18:01,580 --> 00:18:02,920
I may not have any magic!

313
00:18:03,180 --> 00:18:03,980
Who cares?

314
00:18:04,200 --> 00:18:06,740
I can just use my body to mimic it instead!

315
00:18:06,880 --> 00:18:09,760
Ha ha! Without magic, there are limits to what you can do.

316
00:18:09,760 --> 00:18:14,760
What? Oh yeah? Well, in that case...

317
00:18:15,940 --> 00:18:19,380
This is where I push past my limits!

318
00:18:19,600 --> 00:18:21,920
Impressive. How strong is this kid?

319
00:18:23,620 --> 00:18:28,420
Ha ha ha ha! My guy's magic-sucking skill is even more powerful!

320
00:18:29,360 --> 00:18:29,500
Huh?

321
00:18:29,500 --> 00:18:37,660
Secretly setting a trap for a poor, defenseless woman like me.

322
00:18:37,780 --> 00:18:39,100
You should be ashamed of yourself.

323
00:18:40,860 --> 00:18:44,380
Now, now, you can't complain just because you got caught instead.

324
00:18:46,940 --> 00:18:47,420
Seriously?

325
00:18:47,960 --> 00:18:51,820
Vanessa's usually either too drunk or hungover to manage much of anything useful.

326
00:18:52,280 --> 00:18:53,760
The bulls are killing it today.

327
00:18:53,980 --> 00:18:55,200
Really should have bet more.

328
00:18:55,200 --> 00:18:58,960
You said that your knights were junior-ranked mages.

329
00:18:59,860 --> 00:19:02,760
There's certainly nothing junior about the chest on that woman.

330
00:19:02,920 --> 00:19:05,140
Better get that magic stone ready, old man.

331
00:19:06,240 --> 00:19:09,700
There's a real nasty group called the Eye of the Midnight Sun that's after it, too.

332
00:19:10,160 --> 00:19:13,100
I can promise you that you're better off handing it over to us.

333
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:16,880
Ha! You're only saying that because my mages are making a comeback.

334
00:19:17,060 --> 00:19:19,680
At this point, that kind of bluster makes you sound desperate, either.

335
00:19:19,680 --> 00:19:21,160
I'm telling you, we'll win!

336
00:19:21,980 --> 00:19:26,180
The tables will turn in no time once my top mages are able to show what they can do.

337
00:19:26,340 --> 00:19:29,760
I'll have you know my son is the most powerful mage in the Underwater Temple.

338
00:19:34,860 --> 00:19:35,940
This is fun!

339
00:19:36,360 --> 00:19:38,120
You look like you're getting tired, though.

340
00:19:38,320 --> 00:19:39,280
Wanna take a break?

341
00:19:39,720 --> 00:19:40,420
Yeah, right.

342
00:19:40,420 --> 00:19:42,640
I could keep going all day if I needed to.

343
00:19:42,920 --> 00:19:44,680
But if you need a break, go ahead.

344
00:19:45,940 --> 00:19:47,080
Sorry about this.

345
00:19:47,440 --> 00:19:49,780
My old man sure does like his games, though.

346
00:19:50,060 --> 00:19:50,940
Hold on a second.

347
00:19:51,460 --> 00:19:53,160
That crazy old coot is your father?

348
00:19:53,520 --> 00:19:55,140
He's got so much power.

349
00:19:55,520 --> 00:19:56,720
Like a tidal wave.

350
00:19:57,480 --> 00:19:58,480
No doubt about it.

351
00:19:58,560 --> 00:20:00,260
This guy is the strongest one here.

352
00:20:00,980 --> 00:20:02,820
I'll take you both on at once.

353
00:20:03,140 --> 00:20:05,520
I'm not interested in tormenting you any further.

354
00:20:06,280 --> 00:20:08,840
The least I can do for you is end this quickly.

355
00:20:08,840 --> 00:20:12,360
Water creation magic, Poseidon's Hammer!

356
00:20:15,260 --> 00:20:17,460
You're not going to be ending anything.

357
00:20:17,580 --> 00:20:19,700
Yeah, I'm nowhere near done playing with you!

358
00:20:29,580 --> 00:20:30,940
Why is everything shaking?

359
00:20:31,300 --> 00:20:32,640
That's not part of the game!

360
00:20:32,720 --> 00:20:34,020
