361
00:20:38,840 --> 00:20:46,260
Well, it looks like you folks are having quite a get-together.

362
00:20:49,260 --> 00:20:52,380
How about you guys let me in the mix?

363
00:21:08,840 --> 00:21:12,560
Just lately, I've been crying for hours, baby.

364
00:21:14,640 --> 00:21:16,780
I wish you were here.

365
